othesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CFL}\">\\(\\mathrm{CFL}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REGULAR}\">\\(\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"351f87e03faac193\" href=\"?note=351f87e03faac193\" title=\"73-df-cfl-notation\">73-df-cfl-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a2d140de13ec8897\" href=\"?note=a2d140de13ec8897\" title=\"73-df-regular-language-notation\">73-df-regular-language-notation</a>，使用同一字母表。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}3.4}\\vdash\n\\forall L_1\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\;\\forall L_2\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\;L_1\\cap L_2\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}3.4}\\vdash\n\\forall L_1\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\;\\forall L_2\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\;L_1\\cap L_2\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfl-notation","status":"resolved","id":"351f87e03faac193","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfl-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-regular-language-no